          <rules>
            <rule name="Cornered Rats" id="2e64-db5b-8115-46de" hidden="false">
              <description>If a unit of Skavenslaves breaks from combat, any units that they flee through (friend or foe) immediately take D6 Strength 3 hits for each complete rank of 5 or more Skavenslaves left in the unit. The broken unit is then removed as casualties.</description>
