                            <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="08ca-4a32-203d-40c0">As long as Thanquol has at least a single Wound remaining, at the beginning of each of his turns, Thanquol can use the amulet to heal himself. On a roll of 5+, Thanquol regains a single Wound.</characteristic>
