                            <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="ff58-91e4-84d7-e6e4">Magic Armour. The Skullhelm gives Tretch a 6+ armour save and a Magical Ward (4+). In addition, once per game he can re-roll a dice roll. The re-roll can be one of his To Hit, To Wound, armour or invulnerable save, Leadership test, or a Stay Here, I&apos;ll Get Help! roll.</characteristic>
