              </profiles>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Tretch&apos;s Raiders" id="eb7e-52af-18d2-a20a" hidden="false">
                  <description>Tretch can choose one unit of Clanrats or Stormvermin in your army to deploy as Ambushers. If so, Tretch must deploy with this unit. In addition, he and his unit re-roll all failed To Hit rolls when attacking in the flank or rear.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="Stay Here, I&apos;ll Get Help!" id="2936-aac4-1fea-adcd" hidden="false">
                  <description>Once per friendly turn, at the start of any phase, Tretch can leave any unit he is with and make a move of 2D6&quot; as if it was the Remaining Moves phase, even if engaged in close combat.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
