                <rule name="Exceptional Pack" id="47e3-06ff-ef7b-9f4e" hidden="false">
                  <description>If you include Skweel Gnawtooth in your army, you must also include a unit of Giant Rats that he must join. After deploying Skweel into his unit, roll a D6 and consult the Exceptional Pack chart to determine the Giant Rats&apos; special attributes. Skweel will never leave his special pack and may never join another unit.</description>
                </rule>
