              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Result" typeId="008a-8bda-9586-4ae1">Resolve the shots from the previous Artillery Dice rolled. After this, the Ratling Warpblaster fires D6 shots at all units (roll separately for each one) within the model&apos;s front arc that you can draw Line of Sight to.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
