      <rules>
        <rule name="Ratling Warpblaster" id="d125-e2cf-6798-d484" hidden="false">
          <description>After the first Artillery Dice is rolled, you can now decide whether to stop or to roll an additional Artillery Dice, and repeat the process up to a maximum of 3 Artillery Dice. In case a Misfire is rolled, roll a D6 and consult the Warpblaster Misfire chart, no further Artillery Dice may be rolled.</description>
        </rule>
