                      <profiles>
                        <profile name="Scry-orb" id="32a0-3b35-04ad-1201" hidden="false" typeId="ff67-d27f-2eef-bb35" typeName="Enchanted Item">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="9d2e-d14d-dd58-a829">A Verminlord Warpseer gains a Magical Ward (6+) while it carries this item. Once per game, in the Shooting phase, you may choose to throw the Scry-orb. If you do so, the bonus to its Magical Ward is immediately lost for the rest of the game. 


To throw the Scry-orb, place the small round template with its centre anywhere within 12&quot; and line of sight of the Verminlord Warpseer – it scatters D3&quot;. Models touched by the template must pass an Initiative test or be destroyed, with no saves of any kind allowed</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
