                    <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="3df8-4ab0-c4bd-e2ad">Clan Skryre only. The bearer of this item adds a free Power dice to their casting attempt whenever they attempt to cast the Warp Lightning spell from the Lore
of Ruin.</characteristic>
