                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Infernal Bomb" id="ae2f-799f-5ee8-8c93" hidden="false" typeId="ff67-d27f-2eef-bb35" typeName="Enchanted Item">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="9d2e-d14d-dd58-a829">Clan Eshin only. One use only. As long as they are not Hidden, the bearer can place an Infernal Bomb anywhere along their Movement path during the Remaining Movement phase. Place a marker where the bomb is placed. You may choose to detonate the bomb at the start of any Movement sub-phase by rolling a D6. On a roll of 1, nothing happens. On a 2+, the bomb will explode; place the large round template centred on the marker. Any model at the template&apos;s centre takes a single Strength 10 Hit with the Multiple Wounds (D6) special rule. Any models touched by the template suffer a Strength 3 hit with the Armour Piercing (1) special rule.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
