                    <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="9d2e-d14d-dd58-a829">One use only. This item can be used at the start of any of your turns. When used, all enemy units within 18&quot; of the bearer of this item suffer a Strength 3 Hit, enemy units within 12&quot; suffer D3 Strength 4 Hits and enemy units within 6&quot; suffer D6 Strength 5 Hits.</characteristic>
