                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="9d2e-d14d-dd58-a829">Mounted Clan Moulder model only. The bearer&apos;s mount gains +1 Strength and the Frenzy special rule. However, it must take a Toughness test at the start of each of your turns or suffer a Wound with no saves allowed.</characteristic>
