                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="9d2e-d14d-dd58-a829">Clan Eshin only. One use only. This item can be used at the start of any round of close combat. Once used, no enemy units in base contact with the bearer can make Supporting Attacks this round. In addition, all enemy models in the unit suffer -1 To Hit.</characteristic>
