                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="9d2e-d14d-dd58-a829">Clan Pestilens only. The bearer of this item gains the Frenzy and Hatred special rules. At the start of your second turn and onward, if you have any friendly Clan Pestilens character within 12&quot; of the bearer, this item gets transferred to one of them instead (randomise which).</characteristic>
